)) (text "RIG INPUTS  /  HAND-WIRED PROTOTYPE A" (at 20 17 0) (effects (font (size 3 3)) (justify left)) (uuid a3a2230c-f1a4-4ad7-b260-8a5e1e8ae745)) (text "8 MX keys  +  2 push encoders  +  analog mouse stick  /  one native USB cable" (at 20 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid bb84ac3f-a936-4c85-8435-13a098cba5ea)) (text "CONNECTIONS: identical net labels are electrically connected. Pin names are functional markings, NOT physical header positions." (at 20 211 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid 59733e7a-9891-4ca0-bbe7-1af3df962f3d)) (text "USB: PC -> board native USB/OTG socket. GPIO19 and GPIO20 reserved. UART-only USB socket cannot carry our HID reports." (at 20 216 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid de0929df-7d42-4109-bd90-bfd288483266)) (text "KEYS: two electrical contacts per MX switch; either orientation. Enable INPUT_PULLUP on all keys, encoder A/B and push inputs." (at 20 221 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid 90677f88-f1bd-4e32-9ce4-06e080c79ddf)) (text "ENCODERS: passive mechanical A/B/C + isolated push switch. Join C and SW2 locally to GND; 4 wires per encoder module." (at 20 226 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid f82897a4-ea99-446b-8b0a-b288a470fcd8)) (text "JOYSTICK: 3.3 V analog assumption ONLY. Flex pin count/order/pitch and click are UNVERIFIED. No physical FPC pin assignment." (at 20 231 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid 1561afdf-1ded-40de-8af6-878b623bd816)) (text "Four-wire stick: leave GPIO21 unconnected, disable its action; SW5 is left click. Five-wire breakout: click may also use GPIO21." (at 20 236 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid 8b872d2d-873a-4e3e-b793-c555fdcb4e35)) (text "No matrix, diodes or external pull-ups in minimum build. Firmware debounce required. Optional 100 nF from each ADC input to GND." (at 20 241 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid e97cd63a-220c-483c-8c7d-2e3bea54bca5)) (text "Use 2.54 mm solder headers or prewired keyed plugs. Keep GND with each cable. Insulate solder joints and add strain relief." (at 20 246 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid 208da809-06bf-467c-b188-e1a24f5f077e)) (text "REFERENCE BOARD ONLY: check exact clone schematic before wiring. No PCB footprint or manufacturing pinout is implied here." (at 20 251 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid 18cab374-69e9-4389-978d-d6ee63a755cd)))